# suite: node --test --test-name-pattern ^SG:.N-A6.the.delete.refusal tests/e2e.test.js
# Every warn-tier message yields to the notice, so the delete refusal vanishes while the notice stands.
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -903,7 +903,7 @@ footer.seq{row-gap:var(--sp-1)}
    The aria-live copy of the warning (.announce) is a separate element and still speaks. The class is on
